            <hcontainer name="amendedAct" eId="schedule-1__part-1__amdact-1">
              <heading>Customs Act 1901</heading>
              <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__part-1__amdact-1__item-1">
                <num>1</num>
                <heading>Subsection 4(1) (definition of Commissioner)</heading>
                <content>
                  <p>Repeal the definition, substitute:</p>
                </content>
                <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__part-1__amdact-1__item-1__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                  <content>
                    <p><b><i>Commissioner</i></b> means the Commissioner of the Anti-Dumping Commission established under <ref href="#sec-269S">section 269S</ref>MB.</p>
                  </content>
                </quotedStructure>
              </hcontainer>
