                  <p>Insert:</p>
                </content>
                <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__part-1__amdact-1__item-7__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                  <subsection eId="schedule-1__part-1__amdact-1__item-7__qstr-1__subsec-2A">
                    <num>2A</num>
                    <content>
                      <p><ref href="#dvs-1A">Division 1A</ref> deals with the establishment of the Anti-Dumping Commission and <role refersTo="#commissioner">the Commissioner</role>.</p>
